  ------------------------------------------------------------
    the programme
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      0:00  the prairie, and heat shimmer over the grass
      0:16  the tower rises
      0:48  the mesocyclone: rotation, rain, first bolts
      0:48  the drop (the thunder is the bass)
      1:20  under the shelf, mammatus overhead
      1:30  the backside, sun through the rain
      1:52  the rainbow, night, stars

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    how to run
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      Double-click intro.html in Edge or Chrome on Windows
      10 or 11, wait for the bar, then click. No server, no
      flags. ESC leaves fullscreen. A discrete GPU is
      recommended. Tested on an RTX 5090.

